# 懵然不知
(pos:形容詞)
<explanation>
yue:形容一個人完全唔察覺、唔知道某啲嘢發生咗，處於一種懵懵哋、毫無頭緒嘅狀態（量詞：無）
eng:totally unaware; completely oblivious
<eg>
yue:佢俾人賣咗都懵然不知，仲幫人手數錢。
eng:He was completely unaware that he had been betrayed, and was even helping them count the money.
<eg>
yue:公司出咗咁大單嘢，個老細竟然懵然不知。
eng:Something so big happened at the company, yet the boss was totally oblivious to it. [end of text]


